ISO-10303-21;
/* Gn178: analytic CONICAL_SURFACE (apex-reference radius 2.0, semi-angle pi/6, slant length 4.0)
   quarter-wedge ADVANCED_FACE; a consumer requiring SURFACE_OF_REVOLUTION representation (not
   analytic-elementary) cannot use this face as-is; exercises ShapeCustom_ConvertToRevolution's
   elementary-surface-to-revolution branch (cone -> Geom_SurfaceOfRevolution with a Geom_Line
   generatrix basis curve); direction not covered by Gn013's PLANE+BSpline mismatch */
